Error: Jet.MisplacedParameterSeparator: A parameter after `*` in this function type has no label
  --> Tests/UI/fn_type_zone_misplaced.jet:2:30
    |
  2 | apply: fn(action: fn(*, Int) -> Int) -> Int { action(1) }
    |                              ^^
 Why: A label-only parameter is reached by writing its label, so it has to have one
 Fix: Name it, as in `fn(*, force: Bool) Int`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MisplacedParameterSeparator
